# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows/Linux 之间产生无意义的全文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不做换行转换，也不做文本 diff
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.zip binary
*.so binary
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
